      "sentence": "This matches the description for score 4: an implicitly stated action with concrete implementation details.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "The comment only contains an implicitly stated vague action, which matches the rubric description for gold score 2, not score 4. This final conclusion misapplies the rubric threshold."
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "The rationale consistently supports the incorrect score 4 instead of the gold score 2 due to material errors in reasoning and rubric application, so it is classified as supports_wrong_score."
